  {
   "x": 0.55,
   "y": 1.5,
   "w": 7.4,
   "h": 0.45666666666666667,
   "text": "R_iR̈ᵢ + (3/2)Ṙᵢ² = [p_b,i − p∞ − 2σ_b/Rᵢ − 4μṘᵢ/Rᵢ]/ρ − Σ_{j≠i} (Rⱼ²R̈ⱼ +\n2RⱼṘⱼ²)/dᵢⱼ",
   "font": "Arial",
   "font_size": 12,
   "color": "#E7F0F3",
   "word_wrap": false,
   "align": "left",
   "valign": "top",
   "margin": 0.02,
   "bold": true,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "o034",
   "name": "C3-E31 text 34"
  },
  {
   "x": 0.55,
   "y": 2.35,
   "w": 7.4,
   "h": 0.4736111111111111,
   "text": "Neighbours change the pressure each bubble feels, so single-bubble results\ncannot simply be multiplied by the count.",
